From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:33:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] d3d12: Frame generation on MetalFX, command buffer slots and
 blit stats.

MACNEUTRON_FRAMEGEN=1 pairs the last temporal upscale with MetalFX's frame interpolator at present, showing a frame between each two the game renders. DXMT_D3D12_CMDBUF_SLOTS sets how many command buffers a queue keeps in flight (64 by default). DXMT_STATS breaks blits down by kind.
